    // ── front 38 — typography ────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // `§ 9.12`-`§ 9.14`, the one group of `§ 9` that is not text: three
    // list-style properties over six leaves. It is a TOP-LEVEL section because
    // `list-style-*` applies to a list and not to its text, and because
    // `.List.Disc` reads better than `.Text.List.Disc`. `ImageNone` is flat —
    // `§ 9.12` prints only the arbitrary form beside `list-image-none`, so
    // there is no ladder for it to head.
    List {
        None,
        Disc,
        Decimal,
        Inside,
        Outside,
        ImageNone,
    }
