    }

    // ── front 35 — spacing and sizing ────────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // `Pad`, `Margin`, `Size` and `Space`: every numeric leaf below is a
    // MULTIPLIER of `--spacing` and not a length. `spacing(n)` and
    // `spacingHalf(n)` in `spacing.bp` are the only two places
    // `calc(var(--spacing) * N)` is written, and the four dispatchers in
    // `emilia.bp` — under the same banner — consume them. `Flex.Gap` is
    // front 37's and `Layout.Inset` front 36's, even though they space things
